<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="3JN" style="id">- Saafi-Saafi</book>
  <para style="h">3 Saaŋ</para>
  <para style="toc3">3Sŋ</para>
  <para style="toc2">3 Saaŋ</para>
  <para style="toc1">Fiisi Saaŋ kaahayɗoh kaɓɗoh</para>
  <para style="mt">Fiisi Saaŋ kaahayɗoh kaɓɗoh</para>
  <para style="is">Rangsohaani</para>
  <para style="ip">Saaŋ ɓaahee ŋ <char style="w"><char style="tl">Apootar</char></char> ciŋ Yeesu. Saaŋ na Saak na Piyeer ɓeɗ <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ci kaahay ci tiik ciŋ ɓa uup woyu ŋ teereeci nikiis ci na naandsuke kipes kiŋ Yeesu. Marka Saaŋ ŋ Limiŋ tiik ci.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ŋ finho kakaan ki na hulti na rapɗuukiŋ Yeesu, a taambkohiɗ Maryaama, yaayiŋ Yeesu.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 19:25-27">Saaŋ 19:25-27</ref></char></note> Ŋ mirndaani a yi adgohee ɓi Jangu, ŋ ɗiska woysee Asi ŋ jamanoonaam (ɓak ngaŋ ɗiski Turki nik woti-woti). Ŋ jamanoonaam, weɗ a fiisoh "Yegɗohiŋ Muci Saaŋ fiis", na "Fiisi Saaŋ kaahayɗoh kaɓɗoh" wii, na fiis kanak wiiriis ci a kaɓɗoh, na teerndiŋ "Teeɓ ki", wi na woye ŋ in ci na haye ŋ fikiiri.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 1:1">Teeɓ ki 1:1</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="ip">Saaŋ fiis kaɓɗohii ƴaar na woyse Gayus. A fiiseen kaɓɗoh wuu Janguuna Gayus nikohe, waaye Joteref, ƴaar ɓaah ɓi adgoh Janguuna, teyɗukeeɗi wa, te a dalɗeeɗi sah ɓi hayee wa wike, a degga ɓooɓaŋ Janguuna inaa miskiɗ. Wa miniɗ nik ne fiisi kaɓɗohsee weem wa 1 Saaŋ wala 2 Saaŋ, waaye ɓo' inahɗi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Raakeen ƴaar teeku Demetiriyus, a ɓaah ŋ ɓi na pangke na Saaŋ. A joyeen taamb ŋ ɓak caam. Saaŋ eɗta ɗe kaɓɗohii, kaɓɗohiŋ ɗe kaahayɗoh, te a woosa Gayus ne a dalɗaat Demetiriyus baahiɗ. A nammba ɗe woyndoh in ca raak ŋ Janguuna.</para>
  <para style="iot">Fiisi Saaŋ kaahayɗoh kaɓɗoh kaɗtiɗoh an :</para>
  <para style="io1">- Kañɗoh <char style="ior"><ref loc="3JN 1:1-4">1:1-4</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Ñaahoh wuu Gayus na mini a min daliɗ ɓo' <char style="ior"><ref loc="3JN 1:5-8">1:5-8</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Wortuk Joteref <char style="ior"><ref loc="3JN 1:9-11">1:9-11</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Dengkoh ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ Demetiriyus <char style="ior"><ref loc="3JN 1:12">1:12</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Askohi <char style="ior"><ref loc="3JN 1:13-15">1:13-15</ref></char></para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="3JN 1" />
  <para style="s">Kañɗohi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="3JN 1:1" />Mi yii kañiɗ ɗa, Gayus, mi yi yakkiŋ Janguuni, mi yii fiis kaytii wuu fu nawleeso, fu yi ŋ keeñkoh keeh-keeh. <verse eid="3JN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="3JN 1:2" />Nawleeso, mi na kiime Kooh ne fu raak jam ŋ in ci jen. Findi kipes kiŋ ɗa na Kooh wiroh, Kooh onaat ɗa wir faan mand ɗaa. <verse eid="3JN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="3JN 1:3" />Ɓaah ciŋ ɓoo kosiɗ ci hayya ndii ɗah, ɓa na seede'e seede keeh ki nik nga ɗa na findi fu na pesohe ŋ keeh ki ; ineem, ŋ neɓuuɗ nga lool. <verse eid="3JN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="3JN 1:4" />Ŋ kerahha ne komaakciŋ ngo ŋ <char style="w" lemma="Kiristaa">Kiristaani</char> na pese ŋ keeh ki ɗah, sumi mi na sume ŋ ineem, ŋ minɗi raak sum ki uupa.<verse eid="3JN 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Findi Gayus na tumohe na ɓaaɓoh ci</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="3JN 1:5" />Nawleeso, in ci fu na tumɗe ɓaah ciŋ ɓoo kosiɗ ci na ɓaaɓe, po ɓi fu inahɗi sah, fu na tumee wa tum wooriɗ. <verse eid="3JN 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="3JN 1:6" />Ɓa seede'iɗ waaɗi fu waaɗ ɓooɓi, ŋ fiki ɓi Janguunii. Te wa heen baahe lool ne fu ɓaatɗohee ɓaah ciŋ ɓoo ɓeem ŋ ɓaaɓiŋ ɓa findi <char style="w" lemma="ɓo'-Kooh ci">ɓo'-Kooh</char> na tumohe. <verse eid="3JN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="3JN 1:7" />Laam e tiikiŋ Kiristaani tah ɓa kuruk te ɓa heelkuu ali in ŋ ɓooɓi kosaaɗiici. <verse eid="3JN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="3JN 1:8" />Kon ɓoo, kosiɗ ci, e ɓoo joy ɓaatɗoh ɓaaɓoh ceem ne ɓoo hun na ɓa, ɓoo pangkiɗ keeh ki.<verse eid="3JN 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Joteref na Demetiriyus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="3JN 1:9" />Ŋ fiisiɗ kayit, ŋ kaɓɗohhaa ɓi Janguuniŋ ɗu, waaye Joteref taambkohɗi woo kiŋ ɓoo te a waaɗ ne a yi adgohan ɓooɓi jen. <verse eid="3JN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="3JN 1:10" />Weɗ tah ŋ hay ɗah, ŋ hey woye in ci a na tume, in ci moɗaaɗiici naandohaaci a na woyɗe ɓoo. Ineem doyɗi ɗe, a yi ŋ haf ce, a na taambɗukeeɗi ɓaah ciŋ ɓoo kosiɗ ci na haye ndeem te ɓaat nga ɓi na waaɗe wa tum a yi na hondohee ɓa tuma, ɓa sanga ɗah a aañ ɓa ŋ Janguuni.<verse eid="3JN 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="3JN 1:11" />Nawleeso, kina altiɗkoh in baahaaɗi, waaye altiɗkoha in baahiɗ ; ɓoyi na tume in baahiɗ, a ɓaah ŋ Kooh ; ɓoyi na tume in baahaaɗi, a moosɗi inah findi Kooh mand. <verse eid="3JN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="3JN 1:12" />Demetiriyus nak, ɓooɓi jen na woye in baahiɗ nga ɗe te ɓo' miniɗ hot ne wa keeh. Ɓoo namiɗ ɗe seede'iɗ te fu inhiɗ ne in nu ɓoo seede ɗah, wa keeh.<verse eid="3JN 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Askohi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="3JN 1:13" />Raakiɗ in laayiɗ ci ŋ joy ɗa woo, waaye ŋ waaɗɗi ca fiis ŋ kayit findi an. <verse eid="3JN 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="3JN 1:14" />Ŋ oolkiɗ ne ŋ hey ɗa hote maañaaɗi te ɓoo hey woye ɓo' na ɓo'. <verse eid="3JN 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="3JN 1:15" />Jam nikaat na ɗa ! Nawleeci ɓa ɗii kañiɗ ɗa ! Kañɗa nawleeciŋ ɓoo, yaa nu nga ŋ tiikiŋ ɗe.<verse eid="3JN 1:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="3JN 1" />
</usx>